neo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SS8bitF_rjMQ7kNvwGXlh9I&_nc_oc=AdrY6KXXFNNd9LS_2_HZx1qaHvoyS3fGVnqILhjnG7CvhMtoi13QlYtD0T_hBMyeMFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0YwjJy5N1qvs5L7mlfz-vx2GUzYOQZ5xtbb-L53Wi4Wg&oe=69F0D0B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JBN18QUd_VoQ7kNvwF5VImK&_nc_oc=AdqawHkespXrBHahb-74FtKVAlESZ2Z0o9A1h5ShQ22hNCHBmXuPIWJ3jj3p2T7AsCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2UQt_zkaBQCDsgvDQA25xejUV9DXdnYtSf66HDa4ZE9Q&oe=69F099D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rozbh5FgqboQ7kNvwFH2Ko7&_nc_oc=AdpCkc2QqsIXsmGjJinqKtbJPNLclcWh3nfsd0B3wyW8qd7AeN3PhF1dBHOFHc2XFYg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3fALWSAqinv1y4HMwe-7Xy0BmBEfuAwXN0VoryzaGa6g&oe=69F0AEF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974472_629709421448022_713197402145434487_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_